1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:02,600
The tea from this mountain
isn't as famous as Molie or Xi Gui,

2
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:04,159
but the quality is solid.

3
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:05,320
I actually prefer it.

4
00:00:05,519 --> 00:00:06,598
Does it have a name?

5
00:00:06,599 --> 00:00:08,000
Yes, Dongguo.

6
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:12,160
You have to walk through it and love it to
truly understand it. [TN: He's making a pun]

7
00:00:12,759 --> 00:00:13,880
I only have three days off.

8
00:00:13,919 --> 00:00:15,519
And training happens to be near Molie.

9
00:00:17,519 --> 00:00:19,599
Then there's no time to
visit Chahua Village, right?

10
00:00:20,359 --> 00:00:22,199
A round trip to Chahua
Village takes two days.

11
00:00:22,399 --> 00:00:24,239
And it's in the opposite
direction of my base.

12
00:00:24,879 --> 00:00:26,639
Why are you so obsessed
with Chahua Village?

13
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:29,719
Of course. Qingtian and
Wenshu both get to go.

14
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:32,840
I'll have time off after my assessment.

15
00:00:33,359 --> 00:00:34,519
If I fail, I'll go this year.

16
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:35,759
If I pass, I'll go next year.

17
00:00:36,759 --> 00:00:37,520
You have time off this year.

18
00:00:37,521 --> 00:00:38,679
Why wait until next year?

19
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,359
Should I pray for you to pass,

20
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,399
or fail?

21
00:00:47,719 --> 00:00:48,719
You're overthinking it.

22
00:00:48,720 --> 00:00:49,896
If we don't figure this out now,

23
00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:51,360
the remaining two days will be gone.

24
00:00:52,159 --> 00:00:53,559
The roads in Molie are too rough.

25
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:54,920
We won't get anywhere in two days.

26
00:00:57,679 --> 00:00:58,679
I have a proposal.

27
00:00:59,079 --> 00:01:00,079
Shoot.

28
00:01:01,079 --> 00:01:02,839
Want to be my drill
instructor for two days?

29
00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:04,320
To do what?

30
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:11,200
Test my physical fitness.

31
00:01:14,079 --> 00:01:15,079
Like this?

32
00:02:03,700 --> 00:02:11,700
"A Winter Sun Wakes the Wind in Spring Hills' Dream"

33
00:02:15,293 --> 00:02:19,093
(Episode 12: Coming and Going)

34
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:26,560
Brother Guo!

35
00:02:26,759 --> 00:02:27,759
Ah!

36
00:02:28,199 --> 00:02:30,479
Winning that bet really
made you a big spender!

37
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:33,400
Brother Guo, stop making fun of me.

38
00:02:33,719 --> 00:02:35,280
Money is the most useless thing.

39
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:37,120
If you gave me five million,

40
00:02:37,319 --> 00:02:39,318
I'd sort everything out for you perfectly.

41
00:02:39,319 --> 00:02:40,319
Really?

42
00:02:40,599 --> 00:02:41,759
As long as there's five million.

43
00:02:41,919 --> 00:02:43,400
Could you get Han Lu to talk to me?

44
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:46,879
Don't change the subject.
Do you really have five million?

45
00:02:49,199 --> 00:02:51,159
Damn, Qi Haoyu.

46
00:02:51,479 --> 00:02:52,680
Good for you.

47
00:02:52,919 --> 00:02:56,080
When I was your age, I was still
wandering the streets of Shangjing.

48
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:58,560
I told you Han Lu is out of his mind.

49
00:02:58,719 --> 00:03:00,256
Even you know how to
praise me for being awesome.

50
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:02,640
Anyone who hears about this
would give me a huge thumbs up.

51
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:04,199
I just don't get it.

52
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:06,319
Why can't Han Lu figure it out?

53
00:03:06,838 --> 00:03:09,278
If he's out of his mind, why
are you still chasing him?

54
00:03:10,199 --> 00:03:11,759
Well, I have a conscience.

55
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:14,000
I can't just take advantage
of him for nothing.

56
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:16,040
I have to take responsibility
for him, at least.

57
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:17,479
You're out of your mind too.

58
00:03:18,759 --> 00:03:21,319
Our Lu doesn't need
you to take responsibility.

59
00:03:21,879 --> 00:03:24,400
It's hard to say who's
taking advantage of whom.

60
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:27,000
Brother Guo, you really get it.

61
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:29,079
I'm the one doing all the hard work,

62
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:30,240
and he's the one enjoying it.

63
00:03:30,319 --> 00:03:31,559
He's definitely not losing out.

64
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:33,879
Then let him go.

65
00:03:36,479 --> 00:03:38,319
Mmm, this is delicious.

66
00:03:42,719 --> 00:03:43,719
Mmm.

67
00:03:43,800 --> 00:03:45,280
This one is great too.

68
00:03:45,319 --> 00:03:46,879
I'm going to chase him to the very end.

69
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:49,520
Brother Guo, are you
going to help me or not?

70
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:51,120
Don't act all cute with me.

71
00:03:51,479 --> 00:03:52,960
Aren't you supposed to play the top?

72
00:03:53,199 --> 00:03:54,679
Why is our Lu acting
more and more like a top,

73
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:56,160
and you're acting more like a bottom?

74
00:03:58,680 --> 00:03:59,680
Ugh, whatever.

75
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:01,159
I'll give it a try.

76
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:04,120
With our Lu's temper,

77
00:04:05,159 --> 00:04:06,520
you have to infiltrate slowly.

78
00:04:07,199 --> 00:04:09,039
And you have to do it
without leaving a trace.

79
00:04:10,319 --> 00:04:12,120
But I really can't stand you.

80
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:13,879
With all your little stunts,

81
00:04:14,319 --> 00:04:15,759
one word: low.

82
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:18,399
Two words: so low.

83
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:21,279
Three words: so very low.

84
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:25,758
Brother, try some of this.

85
00:04:25,759 --> 00:04:26,560
This is delicious.

86
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:27,680
Mmm.

87
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:32,000
And this one, brother.

88
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:32,879
This is good too.
Mmm.

89
00:04:34,079 --> 00:04:35,079
Good boy.

90
00:04:35,319 --> 00:04:35,800
What are you doing?
Spit it out.

91
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:38,879
I want to see you.

92
00:04:39,279 --> 00:04:41,399
I'm shooting for a magazine
today. I don't have time.

93
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:43,840
Then count backwards and drop the second
word. [TN: Word gymnastics meaning "Make time"]

94
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:46,600
Boring.

95
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:49,279
If he calls again, don't answer.

96
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:51,879
Hey, how many times has
it been since your last event?

97
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:52,920
Not even once.

98
00:04:53,279 --> 00:04:54,279
Not even once?
What are you talking about?

99
00:04:55,001 --> 00:04:56,720
I mean, how many times have you guys met?

100
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:58,000
I can't remember.

101
00:04:58,800 --> 00:05:00,199
So cute!

102
00:05:00,585 --> 00:05:01,785
You've got fujo-brain.

103
00:05:01,939 --> 00:05:03,899
"Can't remember" means
you're hooking up every day.

104
00:05:03,959 --> 00:05:05,079
He gets rejected every time.

105
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:06,319
And asks again every day.

106
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:10,280
Brother Guo, I realized it's a waste
of your talent to be a manager.

107
00:05:10,519 --> 00:05:12,696
You should be the director of
the CP operations department.

108
00:05:12,720 --> 00:05:16,318
Hey, why did Haoyu say "count
backwards and drop the second word,"

109
00:05:16,319 --> 00:05:18,319
instead of the third word?

110
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:20,640
"Count backwards." He
wants to turn back time.

111
00:05:21,279 --> 00:05:22,398
He knows he was wrong.

112
00:05:22,399 --> 00:05:23,958
He just refuses to admit it.

113
00:05:23,959 --> 00:05:26,519
You're just an over-analyzing CP fan.

114
00:05:27,496 --> 00:05:29,174
A Best Actor's manager acting
as your biggest fan leader.

115
00:05:29,199 --> 00:05:30,199
You should be satisfied.

116
00:05:39,519 --> 00:05:40,519
Way to go, Lu.

117
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:43,000
Scoring a solo magazine
cover right after the show aired.

118
00:05:43,199 --> 00:05:45,879
You're rising even faster than Lang Di.

119
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:49,119
Back in the day, Lang Di
stayed by Sister Lan's side

120
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:51,720
when she had nothing and
helped the company pull through.

121
00:05:51,879 --> 00:05:53,879
That's how they achieved
mutual success later on.

122
00:05:54,079 --> 00:05:55,879
I'm much luckier than Lang Di.

123
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:57,295
Riding the wave of good fortune,

124
00:05:57,319 --> 00:05:58,879
I need to take steady steps forward.

125
00:05:59,319 --> 00:06:00,319
Oh, wow.

126
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:03,160
That's easy for you to say.

127
00:06:03,279 --> 00:06:04,920
Do you know how many people envy you?

128
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:07,120
Tall buildings rise fast,

129
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:08,680
but they collapse even faster.

130
00:06:08,959 --> 00:06:10,000
The entertainment industry

131
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:12,160
has never been a place
for building tall buildings.

132
00:06:12,399 --> 00:06:14,255
It's all about separating
the wheat from the chaff.

133
00:06:14,279 --> 00:06:16,119
There's no such thing
as an absolute collapse.

134
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:18,520
I've been in this industry
for so many years,

135
00:06:18,759 --> 00:06:20,279
and I've seen plenty of ups and downs.

136
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:22,920
Any publicity is good publicity.

137
00:06:24,879 --> 00:06:27,160
I still believe more
in what Sister Lan said.

138
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:29,800
She doesn't want to shoot
garbage driven by traffic.

139
00:06:30,199 --> 00:06:32,000
She wants to use publicity to spread love,

140
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:33,720
and turn it into classics.

141
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:35,560
Even after ten or twenty years,

142
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:36,879
people will still remember it.

143
00:06:37,920 --> 00:06:39,480
Those two things don't conflict.

144
00:06:39,759 --> 00:06:41,136
Sister Lan was talking about the essence,

145
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:43,536
and you're currently in the superficial
stage leading to that essence.

146
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:44,959
It's a necessary path.

147
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:47,720
I don't quite get it.

148
00:06:48,159 --> 00:06:49,359
But it sounds very profound.

149
00:06:51,279 --> 00:06:52,720
Mr. Han, there's someone for you.

150
00:06:53,519 --> 00:06:54,519
Who is it?

151
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:57,519
Brother Guo, I know who it is.

152
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:58,959
I'll go take a look.

153
00:07:03,279 --> 00:07:04,279
Just one person.

154
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:06,560
Who exactly has that much clout?

155
00:07:07,079 --> 00:07:09,920
Han Lu was just taken away by someone.

156
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:13,600
Scoring this solo cover must have
something to do with this person.

157
00:07:14,720 --> 00:07:16,399
Ugh, I don't know them either!

158
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:18,079
But Han Lu knows exactly who it is.

159
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:20,120
He wouldn't let me tag along,

160
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:22,399
so my hands are tied.

161
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:29,800
Where is he?
Let's get one thing straight.

162
00:07:30,801 --> 00:07:32,439
You're on your own for this.

163
00:07:33,199 --> 00:07:35,375
Our company doesn't want to
offend a big shot because of you.

164
00:07:35,399 --> 00:07:37,040
Who knows what his background is?

165
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:38,800
But maybe he's not a big shot.

166
00:07:38,959 --> 00:07:40,159
Never mind, I'm just guessing.

167
00:07:40,199 --> 00:07:41,758
Anyway, no matter what,

168
00:07:41,759 --> 00:07:42,999
if you dare to go in there,

169
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:44,719
you bear the consequences alone.

170
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:45,720
I will.

171
00:07:45,959 --> 00:07:46,959
I'm warning you upfront,

172
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:48,359
don't you dare rat me out later.

173
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:49,560
Where exactly is he?

174
00:07:59,639 --> 00:08:00,919
Where do you think you're going?

175
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:02,520
Sleeping your way to the top?

176
00:08:04,199 --> 00:08:05,519
Watch your mouth.

177
00:08:06,759 --> 00:08:07,959
My mouth isn't clean?

178
00:08:08,399 --> 00:08:10,519
Is there anywhere clean in this industry?

179
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:13,398
Yes, I used some tricks.

180
00:08:13,399 --> 00:08:14,399
Played some games.

181
00:08:14,639 --> 00:08:16,519
But I did it all for our future.

182
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:19,040
A man like that,

183
00:08:19,759 --> 00:08:21,319
he just wants to sleep with you.

184
00:08:22,199 --> 00:08:23,600
I have no future with you.

185
00:08:31,199 --> 00:08:32,199
Han Lu!

186
00:08:39,600 --> 00:08:41,200
Do you have a death wish?

187
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:51,799
Sister, I messed up.

188
00:08:52,519 --> 00:08:54,639
Han Lu was taken away by a big shot.

189
00:08:55,399 --> 00:08:56,840
I don't know his name!

190
00:08:57,039 --> 00:08:58,439
About 1.8 meters tall, wears glasses,

191
00:08:58,440 --> 00:08:59,559
neither fat nor thin.

192
00:09:00,320 --> 00:09:02,280
Anyway, he's one of the
better-looking big shots.

193
00:09:13,919 --> 00:09:17,000
Mr. Jin just found out that you
helped secure this magazine cover.

194
00:09:17,159 --> 00:09:18,375
We really need to thank you properly.

195
00:09:18,399 --> 00:09:20,120
I just booked a table at the club.

196
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:21,518
I heard you love French cuisine,

197
00:09:21,519 --> 00:09:23,919
so I specially invited the
best French chef in Shangjing.

198
00:09:24,039 --> 00:09:25,200
I must thank you in person.

199
00:09:25,399 --> 00:09:26,735
Mr. Fang, there's no need to be so polite.

200
00:09:26,759 --> 00:09:27,720
It was just a word from me.

201
00:09:27,721 --> 00:09:29,559
It wasn't really a favor.

202
00:09:33,519 --> 00:09:35,960
Sister, the company doesn't
need to worry about it.

203
00:09:36,159 --> 00:09:37,416
Mr. Jin is helping me secure resources.

204
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:39,120
I'll return this favor myself.

205
00:09:39,320 --> 00:09:39,799
Lu.

206
00:09:39,800 --> 00:09:42,720
Sister, don't hire a chef. I'm hanging up.

207
00:10:09,559 --> 00:10:10,600
Speechless, huh?

208
00:10:15,159 --> 00:10:17,720
Is it that you don't want me
messing with your company,

209
00:10:18,200 --> 00:10:21,320
or you don't want me
messing with your little lover?

210
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:26,960
Good acting.

211
00:10:28,120 --> 00:10:30,559
I love actors with real chops.

212
00:10:42,159 --> 00:10:43,159
Go wash up.

213
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,240
Sister Jialin, I'm sorry.

214
00:10:45,241 --> 00:10:46,600
I was too impulsive.

215
00:10:46,639 --> 00:10:48,239
I was too reckless.

216
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:49,440
I let you down.

217
00:10:49,559 --> 00:10:50,559
I let Lu down.

218
00:10:50,840 --> 00:10:51,960
I'm so sorry.

219
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:55,159
Sister Jialin, I'm sorry.

220
00:11:00,759 --> 00:11:02,559
Brother Guo, come pick me up.

221
00:11:20,559 --> 00:11:21,559
Lu.

222
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:23,799
I let you down.

223
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:26,200
If Haoyu hadn't shown up,

224
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:29,320
this wouldn't have happened.

225
00:11:30,919 --> 00:11:33,600
I should have trusted you
to handle that old creep.

226
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:36,440
You're a kid trained
by Sister Lan, after all.

227
00:11:37,919 --> 00:11:40,840
Brother Guo, don't be sad. I'm fine.

228
00:11:57,919 --> 00:11:59,039
Don't put your glass down.

229
00:12:05,559 --> 00:12:06,559
There's only one standard room left.

230
00:12:06,560 --> 00:12:07,720
The rest are all king beds.

231
00:12:08,639 --> 00:12:09,719
Let Director Jiang have the standard room.

232
00:12:09,720 --> 00:12:10,895
I can't keep squeezing in with you.

233
00:12:10,919 --> 00:12:11,919
Oh, okay.

234
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:16,518
Brother Wenshu, I'll shower first.

235
00:12:16,519 --> 00:12:17,320
You drank a lot.

236
00:12:17,321 --> 00:12:18,735
Take a moment to sober up before you wash.

237
00:12:18,759 --> 00:12:19,759
Okay.

238
00:12:32,759 --> 00:12:34,519
Brother Wenshu, I'm going to sleep first.

239
00:13:07,576 --> 00:13:10,462
["OK, I'll definitely remember,
thanks for your hard work!]

240
00:13:32,636 --> 00:13:35,716
[From careworker Liu Qi:
Mr. Xu, don't worry.]

241
00:14:02,559 --> 00:14:03,720
Morning, Brother Wenshu.

242
00:14:03,919 --> 00:14:05,158
Morning. Have you eaten breakfast?

243
00:14:05,159 --> 00:14:06,159
Not yet.

244
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:08,240
Follow me, I've scoped out the area.

245
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:12,120
Let's go.

246
00:14:24,960 --> 00:14:26,759
Didn't you say you had three days off?

247
00:14:27,559 --> 00:14:30,039
One day to get here, one
day to stay, one day to go back.

248
00:14:30,919 --> 00:14:32,360
Look at you, math genius.

249
00:14:39,200 --> 00:14:41,799
You're taking the dishes I
just brought over right back.

250
00:14:49,559 --> 00:14:51,015
Just carrying them back and forth all day.

251
00:14:51,039 --> 00:14:52,360
I'm not letting you leave.

252
00:14:54,200 --> 00:14:57,320
Don't do this. I'm afraid I'll
fail the assessment on purpose.

253
00:15:16,559 --> 00:15:18,959
I'll walk you to a place where
I can still find my way back.

254
00:15:35,759 --> 00:15:36,799
Where are we?

255
00:15:44,360 --> 00:15:45,120
You drove so far.

256
00:15:45,121 --> 00:15:46,361
How are you getting back later?

257
00:15:47,159 --> 00:15:49,759
Don't worry about it, I rented a car.

258
00:15:50,240 --> 00:15:51,559
I'll drop you off at your spot,

259
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:53,639
and drive back myself.

260
00:15:54,360 --> 00:15:55,799
No way, pull over.

261
00:15:57,399 --> 00:15:59,399
Don't worry about it, go back to sleep.

262
00:16:10,120 --> 00:16:12,200
I have to hand in my phone
as soon as I report back.

263
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:13,798
If you drive back at night,

264
00:16:13,799 --> 00:16:15,439
you won't be able to tell me you're safe.

265
00:16:17,559 --> 00:16:20,039
It'll be at least half a month
before I can see your messages.

266
00:16:20,559 --> 00:16:22,158
Do you want me to spend
every day of this half month

267
00:16:22,159 --> 00:16:24,440
asking you in my dreams
if you made it home?

268
00:16:27,759 --> 00:16:29,959
I'm not comfortable with
you driving back alone either.

269
00:16:31,559 --> 00:16:33,159
At least I can let you know I'm safe.

270
00:18:54,960 --> 00:18:57,599
I've pushed all of this
month's events to next month.

271
00:18:58,759 --> 00:18:59,799
You don't have to, Sister.

272
00:19:01,839 --> 00:19:03,798
Listen to me. Go out and clear your head.

273
00:19:03,799 --> 00:19:05,839
Ask Brother Guo for the
expenses. Make him pay.

274
00:19:07,799 --> 00:19:10,000
Sister, don't blame Brother Guo.

275
00:19:10,240 --> 00:19:11,798
In our industry,

276
00:19:11,799 --> 00:19:12,999
we don't always have a choice.

277
00:19:13,400 --> 00:19:15,519
Since I chose this line of work,

278
00:19:15,799 --> 00:19:18,359
I won't care too much about certain things.

279
00:19:37,799 --> 00:19:39,798
Hey, Sister Jialin gave you time off.

280
00:19:39,799 --> 00:19:40,799
Let's go have some fun.

281
00:19:41,200 --> 00:19:42,920
You go have fun.

282
00:19:45,839 --> 00:19:46,640
Let's go.

283
00:19:46,759 --> 00:19:47,759
What are you doing?

284
00:20:03,200 --> 00:20:04,200
Let's go, driver.

285
00:20:11,759 --> 00:20:13,440
The acting in today's episode is great.

286
00:20:15,440 --> 00:20:16,559
Watching your own show,

287
00:20:16,799 --> 00:20:17,599
isn't it boring?

288
00:20:17,759 --> 00:20:19,039
I'm reading the bullet comments.

289
00:20:19,359 --> 00:20:21,599
It's hilarious. Hey, look.

290
00:20:21,960 --> 00:20:23,318
Someone is roasting your uncle,

291
00:20:23,319 --> 00:20:24,399
saying his acting isn't
as good as Lang Di's.

292
00:20:24,400 --> 00:20:25,840
And he's not as handsome as Lang Di.

293
00:20:25,920 --> 00:20:30,160
Also, "Drag Feng Jianqiu
out and execute her!" Hahaha.

294
00:20:31,920 --> 00:20:33,759
Driver, where are we going?

295
00:20:33,920 --> 00:20:34,920
To the airport.

296
00:20:37,920 --> 00:20:40,920
Qi Haoyu, where are you kidnapping me to?

297
00:20:41,039 --> 00:20:42,319
I didn't bring anything with me.

298
00:20:42,559 --> 00:20:43,799
You can share with me.

299
00:20:44,359 --> 00:20:46,640
Share my ass. I think you're gross.

300
00:20:47,559 --> 00:20:49,119
I don't think you're gross.

301
00:20:49,559 --> 00:20:50,559
Hello.

302
00:20:57,200 --> 00:20:58,518
The room is booked.

303
00:20:58,519 --> 00:20:59,519
Okay, thanks.

304
00:21:05,359 --> 00:21:06,359
Lu.

305
00:21:08,960 --> 00:21:10,400
I want to talk to you.

306
00:21:12,799 --> 00:21:13,799
Go ahead.

307
00:21:16,759 --> 00:21:18,039
You definitely won't admit it,

308
00:21:19,559 --> 00:21:21,160
but I can feel

309
00:21:22,119 --> 00:21:23,440
that you still care about me.

310
00:21:24,839 --> 00:21:26,839
Otherwise, you wouldn't
have hit me that day.

311
00:21:28,519 --> 00:21:30,440
Can we not bring up that day?

312
00:21:38,200 --> 00:21:39,200
We have to.

313
00:21:40,920 --> 00:21:42,759
Just like the things I've done,

314
00:21:43,799 --> 00:21:46,160
they'll pierce your heart like thorns.

315
00:21:47,519 --> 00:21:49,440
I have to pull them out with my own hands.

316
00:21:52,400 --> 00:21:54,359
I don't dare talk about the distant future.

317
00:21:55,960 --> 00:21:58,000
At our age, we have no right to.

318
00:22:00,519 --> 00:22:02,920
But after you yelled at me
and left the hotel that day,

319
00:22:04,519 --> 00:22:07,839
I heard tires screeching on the
street and I immediately ran outside.

320
00:22:11,400 --> 00:22:12,599
I stood at the door,

321
00:22:14,960 --> 00:22:16,599
and you were nowhere in sight.

322
00:22:17,720 --> 00:22:20,240
I stood there for a long
time before I realized

323
00:22:20,759 --> 00:22:22,358
that I no longer needed to think;

324
00:22:22,359 --> 00:22:23,640
my heart just beats for you.

325
00:22:26,599 --> 00:22:28,879
This might be the instinct
Sister Lan always talks about.

326
00:22:31,799 --> 00:22:33,720
It was the same the day
Brother Guo called me.

327
00:22:34,960 --> 00:22:37,519
I felt the exact same way
when I ran to the manor.

328
00:22:40,519 --> 00:22:45,542
That show we did kept
asking how one can learn to love.

329
00:22:48,519 --> 00:22:50,319
I didn't understand it
while we were filming.

330
00:22:52,640 --> 00:22:54,039
Now I have the answer.

331
00:22:56,319 --> 00:22:57,599
Love doesn't need to be learned,

332
00:22:58,119 --> 00:22:59,759
and it can't be learned.

333
00:23:00,759 --> 00:23:02,920
It's either there or it isn't.

334
00:23:22,319 --> 00:23:23,839
You don't have to love me,

335
00:23:26,319 --> 00:23:27,920
but I have to tell you about my love.

336
00:23:29,920 --> 00:23:31,519
I don't want to take it to my grave.

337
00:23:33,440 --> 00:23:36,480
And I definitely don't want to wait
until a day when you'd never believe it.

338
00:24:39,640 --> 00:24:41,119
Changyang went to see him.

339
00:24:45,640 --> 00:24:47,400
Is Shi Yuhao keeping quiet?

340
00:24:47,640 --> 00:24:48,720
Nothing so far.

341
00:24:50,559 --> 00:24:52,920
Hurry up with Xiaoxiao's
paperwork for going abroad.

342
00:24:53,000 --> 00:24:54,000
Yes.

343
00:25:05,799 --> 00:25:06,799
Are you okay?

344
00:25:07,400 --> 00:25:09,559
I'm fine. I was too careless.

345
00:25:21,559 --> 00:25:22,559
Careful.

346
00:25:23,200 --> 00:25:24,319
Be careful.

347
00:26:01,839 --> 00:26:02,839
Brother Wenshu.

348
00:26:03,559 --> 00:26:04,440
Stop working on that.

349
00:26:04,441 --> 00:26:06,241
You should wait for
Brother Chu to come back.

350
00:26:06,799 --> 00:26:08,159
He's even worse at this than I am.

351
00:26:21,440 --> 00:26:23,960
I've been feeling anxious
these past two days.

352
00:26:36,240 --> 00:26:37,799
I come over every day to help out.

353
00:26:38,440 --> 00:26:39,920
Let me borrow your hand for a second.

354
00:26:40,039 --> 00:26:40,839
Coming.

355
00:26:41,039 --> 00:26:42,039
Don't run.

356
00:26:42,759 --> 00:26:43,559
Up there.

357
00:26:43,599 --> 00:26:44,599
Hey.

358
00:26:54,519 --> 00:26:55,559
Where is it?

359
00:26:58,240 --> 00:26:59,240
Over there.

360
00:27:06,640 --> 00:27:08,920
Kitchen, dining room, living room.

361
00:27:09,359 --> 00:27:10,439
Two bathrooms.

362
00:27:10,440 --> 00:27:11,575
Master bedroom, guest bedroom.

363
00:27:11,599 --> 00:27:12,759
And a kids' room.

364
00:27:14,160 --> 00:27:15,160
A kids' room?

365
00:27:15,799 --> 00:27:18,319
Bro, what do we need a kids' room for?

366
00:27:18,440 --> 00:27:19,440
Who knows?

367
00:27:22,240 --> 00:27:24,360
You two being happy
together is better than anything.

368
00:27:25,039 --> 00:27:27,015
Sister Jialin put up the
money, and I put in the work.

369
00:27:27,039 --> 00:27:28,758
I dare you two to never
break up in this lifetime.

370
00:27:28,759 --> 00:27:29,839
Just live here forever.

371
00:27:30,359 --> 00:27:31,359
We won't break up.

372
00:27:31,759 --> 00:27:34,039
Qi Haoyu, you made so
much money from that bet.

373
00:27:34,720 --> 00:27:36,319
Can you pay some rent?

374
00:27:36,920 --> 00:27:39,919
Bro, I'm seriously broke right now.

375
00:27:41,319 --> 00:27:43,239
Alright, you guys can slowly
add the rest yourselves.

376
00:27:43,240 --> 00:27:44,599
Sounds good. Bye, bro.

377
00:27:44,759 --> 00:27:45,759
Bye.

378
00:27:48,839 --> 00:27:50,839
Hey, let's go check out the balcony.

379
00:27:51,160 --> 00:27:52,160
Okay.

380
00:28:08,675 --> 00:28:14,915
Today A'Zha caught bamboo worms for
me to eat, he didn't eat much, so cowardly.

381
00:28:20,922 --> 00:28:26,582
Today, A'Zha brought me to the forest, we went
on a new path and we trekked for two hours.

382
00:28:27,202 --> 00:28:30,855
When I was at the point of exhaustion, I saw
the mountanside covered in rhododendrons:

383
00:28:31,195 --> 00:28:33,102
I thought I wasn't on earth anymore.

384
00:28:34,262 --> 00:28:38,182
Why didn't you, my forest guide, take me on that path before?

385
00:28:39,028 --> 00:28:40,909
Your punishment is to take me next year.

386
00:28:42,615 --> 00:28:47,175
Adding to yesterday's message, I didn't post that place on Weibo. It's our secret place.

387
00:28:47,755 --> 00:28:52,195
Today, I saw Teacher Fu, he
came back from the Tea academy.

388
00:28:52,768 --> 00:28:55,548
He said Qingtian invited him to do an
interview for a documentary for a few days.

389
00:28:55,848 --> 00:28:58,668
A group of people are going back to Molie and staying at our place.

390
00:28:59,242 --> 00:29:02,922
I want Xu Wenshu to pay for them to
stay at a guesthouse, I'm a germaphobe~

391
00:29:11,148 --> 00:29:13,342
[Fang Jialin calling]

392
00:29:19,000 --> 00:29:20,480
When are you going back to Shangjing?

393
00:29:21,160 --> 00:29:22,440
Let me count the days.

394
00:29:23,440 --> 00:29:26,519
Let's see how many more days
you want to run wild out here.

395
00:29:26,720 --> 00:29:28,720
Not going back to the
entertainment industry, huh?

396
00:29:30,000 --> 00:29:32,160
He won't get his phone
back for half a month.

397
00:29:32,799 --> 00:29:34,838
I forgot to ask him last
time if he had any time off.

398
00:29:34,839 --> 00:29:36,759
I'll ask him when he gets his phone back.

399
00:29:36,920 --> 00:29:38,518
If he doesn't have any time off,

400
00:29:38,519 --> 00:29:40,119
I'll head back to Shangjing immediately.

401
00:29:40,799 --> 00:29:42,439
You're staying in the
mountains for half a month

402
00:29:42,440 --> 00:29:44,040
just waiting for him to check his phone?

403
00:29:44,920 --> 00:29:47,559
Not half a month, three days.

404
00:29:48,319 --> 00:29:49,720
We'll know in three days.

405
00:29:51,160 --> 00:29:52,160
Ridiculous.

406
00:30:09,559 --> 00:30:12,038
Mr. Jin, our company isn't that big.

407
00:30:12,039 --> 00:30:14,015
We don't do projects that
cost hundreds of millions.

408
00:30:14,039 --> 00:30:16,319
We can't handle that much of your money.

409
00:30:17,319 --> 00:30:20,559
Ms. Fang, I know your
company has a fantasy drama

410
00:30:20,759 --> 00:30:22,279
that started prep last year.

411
00:30:22,319 --> 00:30:24,359
It still hasn't moved forward.

412
00:30:25,440 --> 00:30:26,759
Whatever the reason may be,

413
00:30:27,039 --> 00:30:29,640
I think very highly of Han Lu.

414
00:30:30,240 --> 00:30:32,559
Investing in him is just
making money for myself.

415
00:30:33,160 --> 00:30:34,559
It's a win-win situation.

416
00:30:35,759 --> 00:30:36,759
It's not complicated.

417
00:30:41,519 --> 00:30:42,519
Lan.

418
00:30:42,640 --> 00:30:45,440
When can I finally let go of
the responsibilities you left me?

419
00:30:46,119 --> 00:30:47,759
Grinding through life is exhausting.

420
00:30:48,519 --> 00:30:50,640
You must be taking it
easy over there by now.

421
00:31:05,559 --> 00:31:06,559
Okay.

422
00:31:08,559 --> 00:31:09,559
Yeah.

423
00:31:17,960 --> 00:31:25,960
Zhu.

424
00:31:58,240 --> 00:31:59,559
Are you still in Molie?

425
00:31:59,880 --> 00:32:00,880
Yes, I am.

426
00:32:01,160 --> 00:32:02,680
We're over here in Nanzhi.

427
00:32:04,039 --> 00:32:05,920
Tell him when you get here.

428
00:32:06,359 --> 00:32:07,839
Don't worry, Mom. I'm here.

429
00:32:21,039 --> 00:32:22,039
Tian.

430
00:32:22,240 --> 00:32:24,080
I'm going next door
to talk to Director Jiang.

431
00:32:24,119 --> 00:32:25,239
Go to sleep if you're tired.

432
00:32:25,240 --> 00:32:26,240
Okay.

433
00:32:45,079 --> 00:32:46,079
Hey, bro.

434
00:32:47,119 --> 00:32:48,440
Where's Brother Wenshu?

435
00:32:49,640 --> 00:32:51,558
He went next door to
talk to Director Jiang.

436
00:32:51,559 --> 00:32:52,559
You looking for him?

437
00:32:52,759 --> 00:32:54,680
Yeah, put him on the phone.

438
00:33:19,000 --> 00:33:22,039
My... my brother just called.

439
00:33:22,599 --> 00:33:24,303
The signal dropped.
You call him.

440
00:33:42,839 --> 00:33:45,279
I forgot to ask for your
location. Send it over.

441
00:33:45,359 --> 00:33:46,359
Okay.

442
00:33:48,599 --> 00:33:50,359
Is... is my brother coming?

443
00:33:54,599 --> 00:33:56,759
Aren't we going to Chahua
Village in a couple of days?

444
00:33:57,079 --> 00:33:58,680
He's bored all by himself in Molie.

445
00:33:58,880 --> 00:34:00,440
He might as well come hang out with us.

446
00:34:37,168 --> 00:34:40,088
[He's forwarding the image from Liu Qi to himself]

447
00:38:33,360 --> 00:38:34,360
How are things?

448
00:38:34,599 --> 00:38:36,760
It's fine. We've been keeping it from him.

449
00:38:37,598 --> 00:38:40,598
I got a room for you. It's 208, upstairs.

450
00:38:41,199 --> 00:38:42,199
Get some rest first.

451
00:38:42,280 --> 00:38:43,400
We'll talk in the morning.

452
00:38:43,559 --> 00:38:44,559
Yeah.

453
00:39:13,360 --> 00:39:15,679
You'll be able to see
the messages in two days.

454
00:39:17,360 --> 00:39:19,639
I left Molie and just arrived in Nanzhi.

455
00:39:21,880 --> 00:39:23,440
Chen Zhu passed away yesterday.

456
00:39:24,599 --> 00:39:26,280
We've been keeping it from Qingtian.

457
00:39:29,400 --> 00:39:31,159
Wenshu called and told me to rush over.

458
00:39:34,159 --> 00:39:35,760
I don't know if you have any time off.

459
00:39:36,400 --> 00:39:38,000
And I don't know where you are.

460
00:39:43,079 --> 00:39:44,079
If...

461
00:39:52,840 --> 00:39:55,679
Don't worry, we're all doing fine.

462
00:41:02,800 --> 00:41:04,879
Dongguo Village is most
famous for its love story.

463
00:41:04,880 --> 00:41:05,880
Not its tea.

464
00:41:06,679 --> 00:41:09,839
We all say Dongguo is
a natural-born romantic.

465
00:41:09,840 --> 00:41:12,480
Its reputation was ruined by love.

466
00:41:14,239 --> 00:41:14,920
Let's go.

467
00:41:14,921 --> 00:41:16,320
Keep up, Brother Wenshu.

468
00:41:52,400 --> 00:41:53,400
Morning.

469
00:41:53,880 --> 00:41:55,079
Morning, Brother Wenshu.

470
00:41:55,440 --> 00:41:56,440
Tian.

471
00:41:58,519 --> 00:41:59,719
What's gotten into you?

472
00:42:00,239 --> 00:42:01,480
Your brother missed you.

473
00:42:02,239 --> 00:42:03,679
The sun must be rising in the west.

474
00:42:04,400 --> 00:42:05,678
I had a really rough trip.

475
00:42:05,679 --> 00:42:08,079
It took 18 hours to drive here from Molie.

476
00:42:08,920 --> 00:42:10,120
Changyang drove for six hours.

477
00:42:11,920 --> 00:42:13,800
Half of my drive was in the dead of night.

478
00:42:14,239 --> 00:42:16,639
Yeah, Changyang could
have made it before dark.

479
00:42:17,239 --> 00:42:18,280
Are you done?

480
00:42:21,079 --> 00:42:23,039
Moneybags Xu, I'm starving.

481
00:42:24,400 --> 00:42:25,400
Come with me.

482
00:42:27,199 --> 00:42:29,480
Stop clinging to me like a leech.

483
00:42:29,679 --> 00:42:31,399
Well, I don't have anyone else to cling to.

484
00:42:33,440 --> 00:42:35,960
Is it fun breaking up and getting
back together with Changyang?

485
00:42:36,880 --> 00:42:37,880
Like a bandage.

486
00:42:38,599 --> 00:42:40,159
Ripping it off and sticking it back on.
